mantle rm476
state ready
dialect plain
accent light broad
tier full
written_for rm_ambrose_greatly
title the tender for a city
fits stage=adult|old
prefers job=official
traits temper=even talk=plain warmth=reserved humour=none honesty=plain piety=ordinary drive=steady
quirk turns_a_plain_brick_on_the_account_table
likes mutton_stew riddles quiet_chapel thunder
dislikes flies cold_tea
fears a_city_sold_brick_by_brick
hopes an_heir_who_can_read_a_street
topics work +0.7 prices +0.5 family +0.4 pastimes +0.3
styles comfort=measured gossip=plain refuse=courteous tease=none
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# prices a street by the door that still opens there after rain, keeps an unmarked brick on the account table, and can wait through a very long refusal.
words
oath! = Flake my best facing brick | Lime in my tea
saying! = Count the street standing | A promise must bear weight
brickend = a plain brick end | a dull red face
limewash = a wash of lime | a coat of white lime
bluepaper = a blue account sheet | a stiff blue docket
redpaper = a red account sheet | a thin red docket
doorjamb = a fitted jamb | a sound upright
archrise = the rise of an arch | the shallow brick curve
teaheat = a curl of steam | a faint stir of warmth
muttonbone = a clean mutton bone | a heavy white joint
crockrim = a rough crock rim | a glazed lip
penledge = a narrow pen ledge | a groove for a pen
gritcloth = a stiff dust cloth | a rag flecked with grit
weighbrick = a table brick | a plain weight of clay
oldstamp = a worn yard stamp | a faint maker's mark
shortsum = an exact little total | a modest sum in ink

grown

opinion houses for 2 : A House has credit for the roofs still standing under its name. In time it must also answer for the roofs which fall.
opinion dole against 1 : I would know the cost of the second helping before I promise the first. The kitchen may dislike the question. The grain merchant asks it.
opinion city for 2 : A fortune spread across this desk can be carried off in sacks. A city has the advantage of requiring a good many carts.
opinion watch for 1 : I can price a well-hung door. The peace that permits a neighbour to open it after dark is an expense I gladly support.
opinion merchants mixed 1 : A merchant who knows the weight of the goods can spare me much of the elegant persuasion.
opinion newcomers mixed 1 : Bring me the evidence of a craft. A place of birth has never yet kept a bead of rain from my ceiling.
opinion church mixed 1 : I go where a question can be put without six clerks immediately laying down their views upon it.
opinion road for 1 : Every wagon bringing sound clay adds a little to the value of a well-kept road. I should like the reverse entry made just as plainly.
line greet : Your business may take as much time as its substance requires.
line greet [pair.band=strangers] : Make yourself known in whatever order suits the matter.
line greet.return : I retain the particulars. Continue from the last sound figure.
line greet [here.time=dusk] : There is enough daylight left to distinguish pencil from ink.
line farewell : I trust the road home will meet its obligations.
line farewell.return : We part with the account clearly understood, I hope.
line ask.how : Has the day proved equal to what you invested in it?
line answer.how : Quite steady. The weight on the table has scarcely shifted.
line thank : You supplied the missing quantity without inflating its importance.
line decline : My answer can be delivered courteously. It remains a refusal.
line accept_decline : Very well. You have priced your own participation.
line deflect_thanks : I would regard a clear understanding as sufficient return.
line sympathise : Sit where the glass will keep its warmth a little longer.
line reassure : There is time yet to distinguish a large difficulty from two small ones.
line react.news : I am listening for the part which alters a real obligation.
line react.news.new : That will have to enter on a fresh docket.
line react.news.known : My earlier entry already accommodates that piece.
line react.news.doubt : I would hesitate to put the weight of a brick on that conclusion.
line react.news.glad [topic.kind=birth|marriage|work|apprentice|succession] : I can welcome a return that costs nobody an additional penny.
line react.news.sorrow [topic.kind=death|loss|theft|assault|arrest|crime] : That loss deserves the dignity of a full and unhurried hearing.
line ack : The quantity and its description agree.
line again.open : We may leave the first page turned over.
line preclose : I think the remaining business will keep until another sitting.
line accept_preclose : Certainly. The pen can rest on its ledge.
line greet.return [pair.band=friends|family] : Come sit where I usually take tea.
line farewell [here.time=night] : May you find the lamp still answering to its wick.
line tell.self : I inspect the thing that is offered before considering what I wish to obtain.
line reassure [pair.band=friends|family] : Bring the smallest part to me first if the whole troubles you.
line react.news [here.time=dawn] : Even this early I have a blank docket within reach.
line decline [pair.disposition=hostile] : Increased volume will not purchase a different figure from me.
line greet [here.time=night] : A late matter. Let us give it the courtesy of a chair.

scene work_1
when topic=work self.job=official
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : At #self.workplace# there is a common brick on the table. I value it more than a decorative weight.
b : Is it a particularly good brick? | Does it hold an account down?
a : Entirely ordinary. The difficulty in business is often remembering what the ordinary article is like. | Yes. A good many splendid undertakings have rested quite literally beneath an example of the thing proposed.

scene prices_1
when topic=prices
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Suppose you have bought every brick in a street. What have you actually acquired?
b : A street, surely? | A great deal of clay?
a : Not necessarily one sound roof. There are the masons, the mortar and the willingness of someone to live there. | Quite. The clay alone will give you very little protection from a late autumn shower.

scene family_1
when topic=family self.parent=yes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A city is a more exacting inheritance than a strongbox. I'd give #self.child# opportunities to study the difference.
b : Where would you begin? | Would you leave the strongbox empty?
a : At a door which still shuts squarely after a wet season. Someone paid for the fitting to be done properly. | Certainly not. It is useful to own the means of repairing the thing one chiefly means to keep.

scene family_2
when topic=family self.married=yes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : For a private meal with #self.spouse#, I put the last docket face down.
b : Why not put the dockets away? | Does turning it over really work?
a : Because the meal is ready and I have learned that this is an excellent moment to stop arranging paper. | It prevents my eyes from returning to a figure. The rest must be managed by ordinary good manners.

scene food_1
when topic=food self.likes=mutton_stew
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : The proper return on a long-cooked joint is a stew in which the meat lifts clean.
b : Fancy herbs as well? | Would you leave the bone in?
a : If the herbs earn the space. Steam from a plain bowl has presented a better case than many an elaborate dinner. | For the cooking. At table I'd like my spoon to meet with fewer obstacles than my clerks do.

scene pastimes_1
when topic=pastimes self.likes=riddles
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I have a riddle. What grows by being distributed and shrinks when shut up?
b : Would you accept credit? | Would goodwill do?
a : Provided it was distributed to borrowers capable of meeting the agreed dates. I had a useful idea in mind. | A very respectable second answer. My own was knowledge of a craft. I'd accept either if the explanation were sound.

scene weather_1
when topic=weather self.likes=thunder
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Under a sound roof I like a thunderclap long enough to set the little panes humming.
b : Doesn't that mean the frames are loose? | Would you open a window?
a : Sometimes. I have paid for useful information delivered on considerably less imposing terms. | Only to smell the wet brick afterwards. The sound quite adequately lets itself in.

scene faith_1
when topic=faith self.likes=quiet_chapel
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : In an empty chapel I sometimes bring a difficulty into the presence of the Bright One, then wait.
b : What answer do you expect? | Do you stay long?
a : I do not require a voice. The question is usually better put by the time I leave. | Until I know what I have actually asked. It often proves shorter than the speech I brought in.

scene work_2
when topic=work self.trade_words
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : #self.trade_words# requires remembering who promised what even after the visitor has forgotten coming through the door.
b : Do you forgive forgetfulness? | Would you ever change the terms?
a : I can accept an explanation courteously. The promised sum has a remarkably independent existence. | Before the agreement, certainly. Afterwards the other party should expect me to remember the terms agreed.

scene friends_1
when topic=friends
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A friend may sit near the warm pot. The account itself remains well beyond the tea things.
b : Would you lend to a friend? | Is that an unkind arrangement?
a : I would state the terms so plainly that friendship need have no influence on the understanding. | I have seen muddled kindness require two apologies where clarity needed none.

scene smalltalk_1
when topic=smalltalk
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I turn #weighbrick# over when an assertion begins to sound too much like its own proof.
b : What does the underside tell you? | Does the speaker take offence?
a : That there is always another surface available for inspection. It has not failed me in any mechanical respect. | I give no opinion of the assertion until the visitor has finished. There is rarely any complaint about the brick itself.

scene animals_1
when topic=animals self.dislikes=flies
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A fly upon a docket can make a remarkably persuasive extra mark beside a figure.
b : How do you distinguish the mark? | Could a fly alter a big account?
a : I wait for it to exercise its independent will. Real figures tend to require considerably more encouragement. | Only briefly. I have never accepted an amendment solely on the strength of its wings.

scene home_1
when topic=home
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I'd like the homeward door to swing readily enough that one hand may carry a full bowl.
b : Isn't that an unusually practical wish? | What if it drags?
a : An estate is made habitable by practical wishes which somebody eventually sees carried out. | Have the fit examined before rasping the bottom. A door can report a fault in the house that contains it.

scene times_1
when topic=times world.times=lean|hard
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A hard season gives every postponed repair a much louder voice.
b : Which one would you hear first? | Might all the repairs wait?
a : The roof above the stores. Wet grain will turn a small delay into an enormously expensive decision. | Only on a blue sheet of estimates. The wind and damp have no obligation to read it.

scene travel_1
when topic=travel
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I prefer walking a street under discussion before considering its worth.
b : Apart from the houses, what merits inspection? | Would you take a clerk?
a : Where a full cart can turn. An excellent warehouse with an impossible approach is a less excellent investment. | Someone who will notice what my eye takes for granted would be worth the shoe leather.

scene memories_1
when topic=memories
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I once set a fine red brick by a plain grey one and invited a visitor to inspect the two.
b : Did the dearer brick win? | Was the red a better colour?
a : The dearer one rang dull where a corner had crumbled. We bought the unremarkable grey. | For a drawing, perhaps. The wall itself was to disappear behind a wash of lime.

scene day_1
when topic=day
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : The tea begins its life hot and my attention can be an unprofitable delay.
b : Do you object to cold tea? | Why not drink before work?
a : Most decidedly. A lukewarm cup has lost the recommendation for which I first agreed to it. | An excellent proposal that has survived many repetitions and an astonishing number of exceptions.

scene weather_2
when topic=weather
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Lime on a brick turns a different white after a shower.
b : Is that important to the price? | Can you match the old colour?
a : To the final appearance, certainly. I'd examine a material in the weather it will actually occupy. | I'd compare it after rain and again when both surfaces have dried. A flattering first impression can cost a full wall.

scene festival_1
when topic=festival
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A holiday street makes the difference between building houses and building a city rather plain.
b : Is it the music? | What do you count at a festival?
a : It is the habit of coming out of individual doors to hear the same music together. | The doors that open without anybody having to be asked twice.

scene health_1
when topic=health
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I take tea across the room so I must rise to reach the kettle.
b : Is that a remedy? | Why put it beyond reach?
a : An arrangement. It encourages me to stand before an entire afternoon has vanished beneath my sleeve. | Sound legs are a considerable asset to neglect over a very minor convenience.

scene news_1
when topic=news world.news
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : The information set before me is #world.news#.
b : Does it change your figures? | Can you confirm it personally?
a : I would locate the obligation affected before altering the first total. | I can distinguish accurately between what comes to my desk and what falls under my own eye.

scene gossip_1
when topic=gossip here.gossip=yes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : The report in circulation has #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.
b : Do you give the report credit? | Would it affect your price?
a : A report is an applicant for credit. It has yet to present its references. | Only when substantiated. The account I'm entrusted with is a little too heavy to balance on an untested tale.

scene newcomer_1
when topic=newcomer
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A newcomer with a sound sample has already made a considerably better introduction than a speaker with three empty recommendations.
b : What do you count as a sample? | Do you always grant a hearing?
a : Whatever shows how the work stands up after leaving the maker's hands. | I'll examine the work within a reasonable hour. Welcome needn't involve favourable terms.

scene faith_2
when topic=faith
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I can stand at prayer without estimating the material if I attend to the quiet.
b : Is it difficult to stop reckoning? | How long can you keep it up?
a : At first. Somebody built that floor soundly enough for me to be free to ignore it. | Long enough to notice when another set of steps arrives. Then I give the visitor the privacy I wanted myself.

scene family_3
when topic=family
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : The heir to a house of business should know how a bad promise feels from the waiting end.
b : Wouldn't that be uncomfortable? | What would you have an heir do?
a : I should expect so. Comfort is a poor instructor in the price of inconvenience. | Wait for an ordinary repair, and make the plain enquiry any other customer would have to make.

scene prices_2
when topic=prices
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A loan too useful to decline ought to be entirely intelligible before the ink dries.
b : Even the last small clause? | What if a borrower dislikes the terms?
a : Especially the last one. Ink costs so little that obscurity must generally be considered a choice. | There will be no unkind words from me. The offer will remain exactly as attractive or unattractive as it was.

scene work_3
when topic=work self.job=official
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I keep #bluepaper# for an estimate and #redpaper# for an undertaking.
b : Why two colours? | Which one would you sign?
a : A wish and a promise look disturbingly alike in ordinary ink. | The undertaking, after reading it. A signature on an estimate should acknowledge only who made the estimate.

scene day_2
when topic=day here.time=night
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : At night I lay the pen in its little groove with the nib facing away from my papers.
b : Why that direction? | Wouldn't a cloth serve?
a : An accidental black stroke can survive a night of perfectly blameless intentions. | It would still be my duty to remember on which side of the cloth the nib lay.

story falseweight [topic=work]
  : I set a brick on two dockets to keep a breeze off the table. One corner of the brick had a little wet lime on it.
  : The top sheet came up with the brick as I raised it. I thought the second sheet missing.
  b : Had the breeze caught it?
  : It lay on the table all along. My first count had included the object in my hand as well as the impression it left.

story buriedspoon [topic=food]
  : A bowl of mutton came with the spoon hidden completely beneath the meat. I sent for a second spoon before I stirred.
  : Two handles rose together and struck the rim quite distinctly.
  b : Did you send the second one away?
  : I used it to serve the next portion. A duplication paid for need not remain an error forever.

story thunderlime [topic=weather]
  : I brought two samples of lime indoors before a storm. Both had looked equally white in the yard.
  : When a flash lit the room one showed a fine warm blush.
  b : Which went into the wall?
  : I waited for morning and had them both put outside again. A flash is an impressive witness with a very short memory.

story archbook [topic=memories]
  : I used a closed ledger and two bricks to demonstrate the principle of an arch to a young visitor.
  : The ledger lay perfectly flat and bore an equally flat expression of contempt from my pupil.
  b : Where was the arch?
  : Nowhere at all. We found the nearest real one. A courteous correction saved an expensive course of instruction in bridges.

story coldseal [topic=day]
  : I pressed my seal on a letter and left the tea on the side until the wax had set.
  : I admired the impression, folded the letter and encountered an entirely cold cup.
  b : Would you reverse the order next time?
  : I did. Hot tea first, warm wax second. No creditor has yet detected the change in my methods.

rule @brick
when concept=bark
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Turn the facing side towards the natural light. | A plain brick will do for this calculation.

rule @tea
when concept=bark self.dislikes=cold_tea
does aside
cooldown 8h
say The tea is still offering favourable terms. | Attend to the steam before opening another docket.

rule @riddle
when concept=bark self.likes=riddles
does aside
cooldown 8h
say A second sound answer earns a second hearing. | A fine question ought to bear some weight.

rule @storm
when concept=bark self.likes=thunder
does aside
cooldown 8h
say There's a figure the glass understands quite well. | Listen to the return from the far roof.

rule @night
when concept=bark here.time=night
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Pen on its ledge and figures under cover. | An entry made in darkness still requires daylight examination.

rule @stew
when concept=bark self.likes=mutton_stew
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Let the meat come cleanly from the joint. | A stout bowl is the right partner for a long-cooked supper.
dlg resident.hub : Set your proposal down in as few pieces as it will reasonably bear.
dlg resident.hub [topic.meeting=known] : #topic.player#, I recall the name accurately. The floor is yours.
dlg resident.job [self.job=official] : My table at #self.workplace# receives estimates and sends back obligations. It is important to distinguish the two.
dlg resident.quirk : An assertion can wait while I put my table brick on its other face.
dlg resident.how [tired=yes] : I have spent rather too long in the company of figures today.
dlg resident.news [world.news] : The account supplied to my table reads as follows. #world.news#.
dlg resident.gossip [here.gossip=yes] : Somebody has put about that #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I have assigned the statement no particular credit.
dlg resident.hub [pair.disposition=wary] : I shall attend to the proposal itself before deciding whether we have business together.
dlg resident.hub [here.time=dawn] : Morning light actually brings out the grain of this paper.
dlg resident.bye : I believe each of us now understands the terms of the other.
dlg resident.bye [here.time=dusk] : The evening should be yours without a further demand from this table.
dlg resident.hub [pair.band=friends|family] : There is both a place for business and a place for tea. Choose the one your visit requires.

graft resident.hub
choice What is a whole street worth? -> brick_street
node brick_street
say Let me begin with a question of my own. Can a laden cart enter and turn without a load having to go into the mud? That affects every house on it.
choice And once the cart has come through? -> brick_door
choice I'll inspect the street in wet weather. -> hub
node brick_door
say Inspect the thresholds after rain. I never thought much of a valuation which treated a flooded downstairs as merely an interesting foundation.
choice I'll inspect the street in wet weather. -> hub

graft resident.job
choice Why have you left a common brick on the account table? -> brick_account
node brick_account
say A sheet can show me what a thousand are expected to cost. My hand tells me what one of them weighs. Both observations have a place here.
choice Wouldn't a particularly fine sample do better? -> brick_common
choice I see the value of the ordinary one. -> job
node brick_common
say A fine sample invites a fine expectation. Most of the wall will be ordinary work. I'd see what I am to receive a thousand times.
choice I see the value of the ordinary one. -> job
